{"text":"邑師慧暢。比丘道因、馬惠初、杜安遷、李方進、潘祖悦、石伯康、劉景林、潘子緒、劉梵達、賈願歸、藍世祖、潘思遠、張元興、潘遵遠、劉思敬、傅冲子、展祖暉、孟龍達、張榮先、孟靈珍、張榮宗、范思紹。神龜元年六月十五日，杜遷等廿三人敬造釋迦像一區，各爲七世父母、師僧眷〔屬〕、一切衆生，俱登正覺。","tags":[{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑師","refId":null,"text":"邑師","start":0,"end":2},{"name":"PersonName","term":"慧暢","refId":null,"text":"慧暢","start":2,"end":4},{"name":"PersonName","term":"道因","refId":null,"text":"道因","start":7,"end":9},{"name":"PersonName","term":"馬惠初","refId":null,"text":"馬惠初","start":10,"end":13},{"name":"PersonName","term":"杜安遷","refId":null,"text":"杜安遷","start":14,"end":17},{"name":"PersonName","term":"李方進","refId":null,"text":"李方進","start":18,"end":21},{"name":"PersonName","term":"潘祖悦","refId":null,"text":"潘祖悦","start":22,"end":25},{"name":"PersonName","term":"石伯康","refId":null,"text":"石伯康","start":26,"end":29},{"name":"PersonName","term":"劉景林","refId":null,"text":"劉景林","start":30,"end":33},{"name":"PersonName","term":"潘子緒","refId":null,"text":"潘子緒","start":34,"end":37},{"name":"PersonName","term":"劉梵達","refId":null,"text":"劉梵達","start":38,"end":41},{"name":"PersonName","term":"賈願歸","refId":null,"text":"賈願歸","start":42,"end":45},{"name":"PersonName","term":"藍世祖","refId":null,"text":"藍世祖","start":46,"end":49},{"name":"PersonName","term":"潘思遠","refId":null,"text":"潘思遠","start":50,"end":53},{"name":"PersonName","term":"張元興","refId":null,"text":"張元興","start":54,"end":57},{"name":"PersonName","term":"潘遵遠","refId":null,"text":"潘遵遠","start":58,"end":61},{"name":"PersonName","term":"劉思敬","refId":null,"text":"劉思敬","start":62,"end":65},{"name":"PersonName","term":"傅冲子","refId":null,"text":"傅冲子","start":66,"end":69},{"name":"PersonName","term":"展祖暉","refId":null,"text":"展祖暉","start":70,"end":73},{"name":"PersonName","term":"孟龍達","refId":null,"text":"孟龍達","start":74,"end":77},{"name":"PersonName","term":"張榮先","refId":null,"text":"張榮先","start":78,"end":81},{"name":"PersonName","term":"孟靈珍","refId":null,"text":"孟靈珍","start":82,"end":85},{"name":"PersonName","term":"張榮宗","refId":null,"text":"張榮宗","